{
  "name": "Web form → AI lead qualification → Excel CRM + Outlook welcome + Teams",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lead form → CRM\nn8n form → AI qualifies the need and writes a personal welcome → **code** sets the final priority (model fit + company size rule) → Excel CRM → welcome email from Outlook → hot leads announced to sales on Teams.",
